"Accumulated over the tree's life (stock). Chave et al. 2005, moist forest, "
"without height; roots ×1.26, urban trees ×0.8, carbon fraction 0.47. Palms: "
"10 + 6.4 · H (Frangi & Lugo 1985). %(co2).0f kg CO₂e."
